  "details": "The upcoming MagicTransit by cloudflare is a new (just announced today) protective service to allow users to have a safer experience, currently they have demos available and it would be a very good to try out ASAP. Every user in VRC needs the same proper protections be it streamer, creator, or even visitor. It would be an exceptional service to have in play\n\n\n\"This service allows organizations to send their entire network traffic through Cloudflare’s secure and performance-optimized network, offering protections against DDoS attacks, while simultaneously boosting speeds\n\nMagic Transit supports any IP protocol or standard, so you could just as easily connect games or email servers to it as you would a standard web server.\"\n\nhttps://www.cloudflare.com/magic-transit/",
